# The balance golden is compared byte-for-byte (harness --check + the round-trip
# test), so it must check out LF everywhere — core.autocrlf=true would otherwise
# hand a CRLF copy to every fresh clone and fail the gate on checkout alone.
# Deliberately narrow: normalizing the whole repo would churn every file. Globbed so
# a renamed or additional golden stays covered instead of silently falling out.
tools/*-golden.txt text eol=lf
